      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am working on moving the boot image from being constructed by singleton+configuration to a boot_image module and have some questions about this code.\n\nThe UseArtImage is enabled for jitzygote builds. When set to true we seem to use a hybrid boot image with the dexfiles and dexlocations from the default boot image being passed through to dexpreopt PreoptBootClassPath... config but using the art boot image to do everything else.\n\nWhy do we do that?",
      "revId": "40139d6422114672770fc9051c346f8f1aba79d9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
